{"id":2188,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>为深入传承弘扬五四精神，选树青年先进典型，夯实思想育人与学风育人工作根基，2026年6月2日16:30，航空宇航学院纪念五四运动107周年表彰暨2026年学风建设大会于瑾瑜国际会议中心隆重举行。学院党委书记罗建国、党委副书记张丽花及全体辅导员出席本次大会，受表彰学生以及2024、2025级学生代表参会。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=qMlVpVoRQkLll8Uv8rVn7lsol-sL8L6iM7r7LRl4MznVnR70gihFp2hmCIa0LkyboSybMYhkLN-DL4-sMzN4LRMVUNWRnlQfnzA7LmMVM7WFM8C4MN7aM4fFM7VkU4NJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aM4GsgtA8pU_cc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10707&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/09997B2B632759303EBBCEFAE8D23E4B/7F36A070/4ABC9\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=qMlnpkL7rfozWfUvzCDL4Afnm-bMz768LRTkn7LPUmLYLm90gihFp2hmCIa0n1yDnSyiU1ysM4QfMz7sU8LsMR9iL8l8nmAVnmNiMmA2UNrFMRlbL4MfMlWFM8nkU4LDgtXaQ4Oeo4xwqsAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSyPLRvaMYbw62_8c&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10707&e=.jpg\"></p><p>大会在铿锵嘹亮的国歌声中正式启幕。会上，党委副书记张丽花集中宣读各类评优表彰文件，依次通报团内先进集体、优秀个人、青马工程优秀学员、考研优秀宿舍、最美宿舍以及中北大学第四十四届大学生田径运动会优秀运动员获奖名单。随后，与会领导、老师依次为获奖集体与个人颁发荣誉证书，以荣誉表彰实干，以标杆领航学风。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=qnRfpfMR67MRQ2Mv7VVMm67LmLanNU6PMlr2UzL4M7Lanl-0gihFp2hmCIa0oSybU1yDLYyZUzWVU4v8LzNbozUYU4vYU8VkM4MVUNCZLRnFnlLbLz9PUm6FMRL4L4-Jqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aM4GsgtA8pU_cc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10707&e=.jpg\" draggable=\"false\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/99B638A2EC74199942C72CAB73EBF804/EC9181B7/43332\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"400px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=qU8Qp7olVVoznRMv4Nio7WkM4CDM4V62L8CDL7WfM778MzN0gihFp2hmCIa0okybLkhkMSyZLRL8L7r2LzWRU87PoRV7L4viLznVLm-sU8MFozM2nzNZLRrFM4liU4rkgtXaQ4Oeo4xwqsAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSyPLRvaMYbw62_8c&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10707&e=.jpg\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=qnRNpYMlMkU47aUv4NZLzlbozN4oRG6DM8l8nzWVUNCsnR-0gihFp2hmCIa0LSyDLYyaokyPoz7iM47DL8WkM8-bnN74M8liM4f7LNVkL8WFozWknNLZLlnFL8-DMzGJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aM4GsgtA8pU_cc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10707&e=.jpg\" draggable=\"false\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/1630819157163BB7B9FA37E570D2AB3B/92BFC81D/3B650\" vheig