tual_attach_file.vsb?afc=qLz9psnmnkU4GanvNMVnmliMmG4Um667MNUPnNr7Uz94nzN0gihFp2hmCIa0UYyZMkybLkhRn7W7LlL8M47PU47iL4U4olUYU4WRoRlDUlQFL4NDLz9PM46FM4lsUzQ7gtXaQ4Oeo4xwqsAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSyPLRvaMYbw62_8c&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10707&e=.jpg\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=qnzLpZo7VfnzLiLvmCbMNnfL4-ZMml6bM7L8LRNZLz9bU4U0gihFp2hmCIa0L1yiMkyaU1h2U87anRGYL4AfU4NiMz7YolUanzliMRAVMNVFnRU4UNCbo7VFMRNDMlUJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aM4GsgtA8pU_cc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10707&e=.jpg\" draggable=\"false\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/2540BFCA0D0238AC955129D0E5548E6A/D43BF98A/4965D\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"400px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=qM4lpanmAkozU4MvzAVoRN8Mz9bMmr67nRLPo7rknlWRUm70gihFp2hmCIa0nSh2Lkh2UYh2L8r7nl78UlW2LmrRM8UZLlCaLNlaMN-iM4AFo7L4MNW2MzQFM4lYLRVfgtXaQ4Oeo4xwqsAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSyPLRvaMYbw62_8c&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10707&e=.jpg\"></p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 颁奖环节结束后，四位优秀学生代表依次上台分享成长经验。五四红旗团支部23180142团支部书记杨雅涵围绕支部思想引领、制度建设、学风培育展开分享，介绍支部依托团学活动抓实日常学业，接连斩获优良学风班、先进团支部等多项荣誉的建设路径；中北大学“十大青年”提名奖获得者马剑涛立足自身求学成长历程，分享日积月累、脚踏实地的治学感悟，勉励青年学子戒除浮躁心态，持之以恒深耕专业学习；全员上研宿舍文瀛17#2031代表焦佳乐从考研、保研双线备考切入，详细分享宿舍作息统筹、结伴督学、资源共享的宝贵经验；最美宿舍代表吴欣芮以宿舍微单元建设为落脚点，阐述从日常作息、内务管理入手，以自律共建优良舍风、筑牢基层学风的实践举措。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=qnmCpbLR67L7l4LvR62Lz67LR6VMlV6VMRNaMz7DMm7aMNC0gihFp2hmCIa0MYhkoShkokhRLzGsLl7snN7bn7CsnmQVLNUinNV2UznVMzrFo7nkLzLaU4VFLNl4MRCJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aM4GsgtA8pU_cc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10707&e=.jpg\" draggable=\"false\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/7B9B8C1071A7FA9DF7F6E2D5FAFA4E55/8DB130C1/2E346\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"400px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=qL4vpZM4-sMRA2Mv7MRM8r2MRW7MzC6DoRlDMRv8MRW7M870gihFp2hmCIa0n1h7LSyZLkhfL7M2ozWfnNLboR9DMmCioznkoRN8nlC4MmAFMzviMNlPnzfFMNrRoz67gtXaQ4Oeo4xwqsAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSyPLRvaMYbw62_8c&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10707&e=.jpg\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=qMzlp8UlM2Mz6VMv4NbL7lDMz6knmU6aU8liUNVRLNlin7U0gihFp2hmCIa0n1hRLky4MSh2U8CPnRlbn7UiU4vinRGZnRl4MzT2LNUboRWFU4VVnmQ7nNQFL8lDU8-Jqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aM4GsgtA8pU_cc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10707&e=.jpg\" draggable=\"false\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/FC035FCF1D59DD5C75D08D5359F2D982/C1EF6DFF/3E6CB\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"400px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=qU47paMzNYM7CsLv7n2LmAVUmlZnzG6YU8M7nl74U4C4U8C0gihFp2hmCIa0nkhRoSysU1hfLzGsUNCaUzTRnRffnmWfLNV7M4TVo7rfU8QFMmCYozf2o7rFM8QRL8r2gtXaQ4Oeo4xwqsAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSyPLRvaMYbw62_8c&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10707&e=.jpg\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=qLzWpVM8MkM7n7Lv7-YMzVRLm74L496bU4G8LRMfnzv4nzG0gihFp2hmCIa0n1h2okyDUYhVLlnVn7n7L7L4nRNiLl7snRWRU4NYUzQVnzrFLznVU8Q2nNMFL8Q2nlCJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aM4GsgtA8pU_cc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10707&e=.jpg\" draggable=\"false\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/FF86CE1DEDDD0C3D951A7D2CC92A6EE5/14ECFFFC/3FFEF\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"400px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=qMmGpYL49DUNLDUvNliMR-YU4Gsnzf62oRAknmWfnzCZozN0gihFp2hmCIa0MkhfL1ysUYysozl8LR9iUNLsLzl8LNW2LlnVUzl8U4rkLRQFMlUaMm9Zo7WFM8LZLRLDgtXaQ4Oeo4xwqsAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSyPLRvaMYbw62_8c&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10707&e=.jpg\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=qUNLpYUlQVM8l8nvlLin77ZU4NDozG6sL4LZLznknzUZLRl0gihFp2hmCIa0M1ysLSysMYhRLN-4n7CaoRCPLm-sUzQ2UmAfLmCsozVRM4VFLz-aM8nkU4VFL8rfM7LJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aM4GsgtA8pU_cc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10707&e=.jpg\" draggable=\"false\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/67177C2B3DF0861227A6FB8A26791C71/1207DBC1/3EA4C\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"400px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=qozLpDLl7YMmn2MvNWVL8-bnN7sUzC6iLRTVM87ZnRrRLl70gihFp2hmCIa0okysLYy4MYyDL7-DUmvioRLsLmffM8lYnNrfMRCPoRfRoRnFnN7DM4-Do7VFM4GZLmvagtXaQ4Oeo4xwqsAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSyPLRvaMYbw62_8c&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10707&e=.jpg\"></p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;在考风考纪动员环节，李靖楚同学作动员发言。他结合校纪校规与考试管理规定，从端正备考心态、科学高效复习、严守考场规则三个方面进行宣讲，细致阐明考试违纪、作弊相关处分细则，深入剖析失信应考对个人学业、发展的负面影响，告诫全体同学摒弃投机侥幸心理，把重心放在日常复习巩固上，依靠自身真实学识完成各项考核，筑牢诚信应试思想防线。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=qLNLpPLNrVLmVRLv8C8L4UDMzV2L8L6iUzGDoRNYMNW7L4v0gihFp2hmCIa0L1yankh7MYyZozfVUNW2nz94MzCinm62L7QknmUZM4GYozfFnNrkoR9bnNnFL8-YLzvJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aM4GsgtA8pU_cc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10707&e=.jpg\" draggable=\"false\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/20DD7890EBBFE83565F7F0FBF4870290/FEB889FD/3B217\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"400px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=qnz-paoRUYLRUsovRrRMRNDnzQ7M4C6ZnmW2LNU4nNCYMz90gihFp2hmCIa0LYyZn1ysLYyDo7CaL7liUz7PMmA2U8V2U4nVM8CZU8LiLRVFLRU8oR6RLzTFM47DnRrfgtXaQ4Oeo4xwqsAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSyPLRvaMYbw62_8c&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10707&e=.jpg\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=qLNMp7olrVLR-sMvl-PMRGZL778oRU6inzGPL8l4MmW2Ll-0gihFp2hmCIa0M1y4oSysLkyiLRTVUN-bLzNDUznkoRU4oRGsnmCDolC8nlWFMRrRnRr7nzrFMzUiMmGJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aM4GsgtA8pU_cc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10707&e=.jpg\" draggable=\"false\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/63970509EBB9196A4B843807F669F4EB/45CD5DE5/54560\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"400px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=qMzMp7UNlPLNUaMv46fU4QfL87inz-6DM7QRUzV2L7MfLll0gihFp2hmCIa0M1h2LSyYLkyPU8linmN4MRQVnR-8LRQ7Mz9DMmvYL7V7LmMFL4AfL7lPM46FM8UPnzNbgtXaQ4Oeo4xwqsAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSyPLRvaMYbw62_8c&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10707&e=.jpg\"></p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;宣讲完毕，学生代表杨宵带领全场同学进行诚信应考宣誓，全体学生举起右拳，以铮铮誓言绷紧考纪之弦，厚植诚信治学理念。</p><p>会议尾声，学院党委书记罗建国作总结讲话。他充分肯定全院青年学子在思想成长、学业科研、集体建设中取得的亮眼成绩，立足航空宇航学院的专业特色与行业使命，寄语全院青年学子，以身边先进典型为榜样，传承五四爱国奋斗初心，厚植航空航天报国情怀，锚定航天强国奋斗目标，胸怀理想、勤学笃实、躬身钻研，把个人学业成长融入国家航空航天事业发展大局，珍惜青春韶华、勇担时代青年使命。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=qLzNpYL47snz6fLv8lYM77sL4W2nzC6sMm9YozMRMR-8UmL0gihFp2hmCIa0M1yYL1ysnSyaoz-iL87DLzvsnRrfUzC8UmLiLNW7MzMkUNWFL8VRMmARnRrFMRM7nRlJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aM4GsgtA8pU_cc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10707&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/6227E09253A6177D5AA64B352BD53BBB/3AC68CD5/43DD5\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=qUmWp7nzLZL8U4LvlLDo7rVn7LZUz-6sMRAfLNlZnlLPnmL0gihFp2hmCIa0U1yZMSh2MYyYMzMVUNQ2U8r2M4VkM4lPL8L4n7lbozlsnmrFL7-8nNQknNnFo77sLRAVgtXaQ4Oeo4xwqsAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSyPLRvaMYbw62_8c&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10707&e=.jpg\"></p><p>大会在激昂的团歌声中圆满落幕。本次大会是学院团委落实思想引领、抓实学风建设的重要抓手，以表彰立标杆、以分享传经验、以动员正学风，进一步凝聚全院学子奋进力量，为学院长效化学风建设夯实思想根基。</p></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://hkyh.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=qMlVpVoRQkLll8Uv8rVn7lsol-sL8L6iM7r7LRl4MznVnR70gihFp2hmCIa0LkyboSybMYhkLN-DL4-sMzN4LRMVUNWRnlQfnzA7LmMVM7WFM8C4MN7aM4fFM7VkU4NJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aM4GsgtA8pU_cc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10707&e=.jpg"}